{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0884"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge belief/religion","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/belief__religion.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",969],["+","\n- The chakras, the energy centres of Indian teaching, are counted along the spine from its base to the crown of the head. The most common system, especially in yoga, has 7 main chakras; older Buddhist texts name four or five, and the seven-chakra scheme reached the West in 1919 through Arthur Avalon's book \"The Serpent Power\"."],["=",17],["+","seven chakras, "],["=",61]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",913],["+","\n- Die Chakren, die Energiezentren der indischen Lehre, werden entlang der Wirbelsäule von ihrem Ansatz bis zum Scheitel gezählt. Das verbreitetste System, besonders im Yoga, kennt 7 Hauptchakren; ältere buddhistische Texte nennen vier oder fünf, und das Schema der sieben Chakren gelangte 1919 durch Arthur Avalons Buch „The Serpent Power“ in den Westen."],["=",13],["+","sieben Chakren, "],["=",63]]}]},
